	measure '% HHI Pais Destino' = ```
			
			VAR __TabelaShare = 
			    ADDCOLUMNS(
			        VALUES(dim_countries[country_name]),
			        "@Share", [% Participacao no Total Exportacoes]
			    )
			RETURN
			    SUMX(__TabelaShare, [@Share] ^ 2)
			```
		formatString: 0.00%;-0.00%;0.00%
		displayFolder: Medidas\03. Performance & Preço
		lineageTag: 683cff61-98d5-45c7-873c-72abfd71391b

